{"sections":[{"slug":"伴随给出单子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"伴随给出单子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随给出单子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"伴随给出单子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设函子</span> $L\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$, $R\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间有一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $L\\dashv R$, <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $RL\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$,</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余单子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $LR\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal D$;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">其中</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">单子</span> $RL$ <span lang=\"zh\">的结构映射</span> $\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}\\to RL$ <span lang=\"zh\">为伴随的单位</span>, $RLRL \\to RL$ <span lang=\"zh\">来自伴随的余单位</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">余单子</span> $LR$ <span lang=\"zh\">的结构映射</span> $LR \\to \\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal D}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为伴随的余单位</span>, $LR \\to LRLR$ <span lang=\"zh\">来自伴随的单位</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个抽象的解释是</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/游走的伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走的伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中包含了游走的结合代数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}